      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nuevo%2C_California",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town sits just east of Lake Perris, tucked into the foothills of the San Jacinto Mountains.",
